<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 22px; color: #0A2463; margin: 0 0 18px;" align="center">Thank you for attending!</h2>
<p style="text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="left">Block by block, the City Attorney’s Office and our partners at Columbus Police and Code Enforcement are working hard to keep Columbus safe—and we can’t do it without your support and engagement. Please take a moment to share your thoughts, questions, and concerns following last night’s meeting.</p>
